  "description": "Adrian Junge discovered that FFmpeg incorrectly handled certain subtitle\ndata. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of\nservice or execute arbitrary code. (CVE-2026-70628)\n\nAdrian Junge discovered that FFmpeg incorrectly handled certain video\nfiles. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of\nservice or execute arbitrary code. This issue only affected Ubuntu\n22.04 LTS and Ubuntu 24.04 LTS. (CVE-2026-70632)",
